sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Kubeflow
    participant THub as training_hub API
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant Callback as TrainingHubCallback

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Callback: Flow 1: GRPO Training (ART Backend, Single-GPU)
        User->>THub: lora_grpo(model, dataset, ...)
        THub->>Registry: resolve("lora_grpo", backend="art")
        Registry-->>THub: LoraGrpoAlgorithm + ART Backend

        participant Subprocess as Spawned Subprocess<br/>mp.spawn
        participant vLLM as Ephemeral vLLM<br/>localhost HTTP
        participant GPU as GPU Memory<br/>Unsloth LoRA

        THub->>Subprocess: mp.get_context("spawn")
        Subprocess->>vLLM: Start co-located vLLM server
        vLLM-->>Subprocess: Rollout generations (HTTP/loopback)
        Subprocess->>GPU: Unsloth LoRA training
        GPU-->>Subprocess: Training complete
        Subprocess->>Subprocess: Write training_results.json to disk
        Note over Subprocess: os._exit() for clean shutdown<br/>(vLLM non-daemon threads)
        Subprocess-->>THub: Results (disk-based IPC)
        THub->>Callback: on_training_end()
        THub-->>User: Result dict
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,Callback: Flow 2: GRPO Training (verl Backend, Multi-GPU)

        participant Torchrun as torchrun Subprocess
        participant FSDP as FSDP Workers<br/>NCCL/GPU
        participant vLLM2 as Co-located vLLM<br/>In-process

        User->>THub: lora_grpo(model, dataset, backend="verl")
        THub->>Registry: resolve("lora_grpo", backend="verl")
        THub->>Torchrun: subprocess.Popen with Hydra CLI overrides
        Torchrun->>FSDP: Distribute across GPUs (NCCL)
        FSDP->>vLLM2: Rollout generation (in-process)
        vLLM2-->>FSDP: Generated responses
        FSDP-->>Torchrun: Checkpoints + metrics (disk)
        Torchrun-->>THub: Training complete
        THub-->>User: Result dict
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,Callback: Flow 3: GEPA Prompt Optimization

        participant LLM as LLM API Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
        participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

        User->>THub: gepa(prompts, reward_fn, ...)
        THub->>Registry: resolve("gepa")
        THub->>LLM: POST prompt completions<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY<br/>TLS 1.2+
        LLM-->>THub: LLM responses
        Note over THub: Genetic-Pareto optimization<br/>Evolve prompts over generations
        THub->>MLflow: Log experiment (optional)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        THub-->>User: Optimized prompts (disk)
    end
